#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2838
msgid "Zoneheater mode"
msgstr "Zoneheater mode"

#: src/libslic3r/PrintConfig.cpp:2839
msgid ""
"Zoneheater operation mode.\n"
"Off: no zoneheater commands are emitted.\n"
"Static: a fixed power level (zoneheater_static_power) is set once at the start; the variable tool "
"is disabled.\n"
"Variable: per-layer power is controlled via the variable zoneheater power profile; the static "
"power setting is inactive.\n"
"Cranial (experimental): per-object, per-layer axis gradient mode with center/edge power bands.\n"
"Adaptive: automatic adaptive heating (uses zoneheater_adaptive_multiplier)."
msgstr ""
"Zoneheater operation mode.\n"
"Off: no zoneheater commands are emitted.\n"
"Static: a fixed power level (zoneheater_static_power) is set once at the start; the variable tool "
"is disabled.\n"
"Variable: per-layer power is controlled via the variable zoneheater power profile; the static "
"power setting is inactive.\n"
"Cranial (experimental): per-object, per-layer axis gradient mode with center/edge power bands.\n"
"Adaptive: automatic adaptive heating (uses zoneheater_adaptive_multiplier)."

